1049,Professional RO Installation,"Aerus Alkaline Drinking Water System – Professional Installation
Investment: $450.00

Service Provider: Professionally installed by Liberty Pure Solutions (Over 40 years of specialized water treatment experience).

System Description:
This is a high-performance, multi-stage Reverse Osmosis (RO) purification system designed to provide ''Healthy Water'' directly at your point of use.

How It Works:

Purification: The system uses a semi-permeable membrane to strip away ''clutter'' and Total Dissolved Solids (TDS) that standard carbon filters leave behind.

Alkaline Remineralization: Unlike standard RO systems that leave water ''dead'' or acidic, our process adds back essential minerals. This raises the pH to an alkaline level, providing superior hydration and a clean, crisp taste.

Final Polishing: Water is polished through a final stage to ensure it is the highest quality possible for drinking and cooking.

Installation Details:

Includes professional mounting of the system, connection to your existing plumbing, and installation of a dedicated designer faucet.

Please Note: Standard installation covers under-sink mounting. Additional labor/material charges may apply for non-standard requests, such as basement installations, custom shelving requirements, or running lines to remote ice makers.",450.00,0.00,service,Water Installation Fees,,,0,0,0
