1760,Plumber Installation,"💧 ORIGINS HOME WATER SYSTEM INSTALLATION
Professional Installation & Craftsmanship

Complete Setup: Your investment includes all necessary valves, gauges, premium fittings, tees, pipes, tubes, and professional labor. (Estimated 3–5 hours of dedicated installation labor per system component).

The Bypass Protocol: Our technicians will plumb a dedicated system bypass as the first order of business upon arrival.

Proactive Preparation: To safely connect your new system, the main water supply to the home will be temporarily paused for an estimated 30–60 minutes. Please use this window to make any necessary adjustments prior to our arrival.

45-Day Elite Craftsmanship Warranty

Our trained Aerus installation technicians, alongside the master plumbers at Liberty Pure, fully warranty all physical installation work for 45 days following completion.

Should any component require an on-site service evaluation outside of this 45-day protection window, a standard $150.00 store service call fee will apply, plus any necessary parts and labor.",1250.00,0.00,service,Labor,,,0,0,0
