1012,Guardian Angel,"The Beyond Guardian Angel is a portable, True HEPA air purifier with 5 stages of filtration that reduces 99.97% of contaminants from the air, as small as 0.3 micron.
Coverage of up to 1,000 sq, ft.

Recommended Maintenance:  

Angel Hepa Filter should be replaced annually

Outer Blanket

Disclaimer: It is recommended you replace filters annually.  If you use filters  or products that are non-Aerus filters and products this can void your warranty, and effect the performance of your unit.

When you service your Indoor air products and on the service due date, if not all aftermarket is not changed at due date and the technician needs to come back out to install one of the above parts you will be charged a $50.00 service fee. It is HIGHLY recommended that all aftermarket are changed out yearly.",800.00,226.00,product,Beyond by Aerus,616,Aerus,0,1,1
1013,Hydroxyl Blaster,"Our most powerful Active Pure unit houses FOUR total cells allowing it to combat even the most difficult of all air quality problems. 
The Aerus Hydroxyl Blaster is an indoor air purifier that has proven to kill 99.98% of the SARS-CoV-2 viral particles on surfaces within 7 hours and mold & mildew in even less.
ActivePure Technology relies on chemistry, not chemicals, to transform your air into powerful and effective molecules. ActivePure utilizes a photocatalytic process defined as a light source and catalyst to make a chemical reaction more likely to happen by reducing the activation energy required.",1000.00,295.00,product,Beyond by Aerus,667,Aerus,0,1,1
1014,Apollo 2000 Heater,"The Apollo 2000 is a portable space heater with style! It's sleek design uses all-new materials for faster heating and greater efficiency, protecting against overheating or if the unit is tipped off balance. It senses the temperature in it's environment and adjusts itself accordingly, working faster or slower to achieve the desired temperature. Comes with a large digital touch control panel that displays the temperature while providing various heating modes, timer options, and oscillating controls. A remote control with the same functions as the display panel is included.

•Large LCD Display
• PTC Bulb-free Heating Technology
• Touch Screen Digital Control Panel
• Beep Tones and Indicator Lights
• Remote Control
• Precise Temperature Sensor
• Self-Adjusting Motor
• Safety Tip-Over Switch
• Auto Shut-Off Function
• Timer for Sleep Mode
• Optional Oscillation
• Low Maintenance
• Portable and Lightweight
• Separate Safety Main Power Switch
• Easy-Grab Carrying Handle

Rated Wattage: 1,800
Electrical: 120 VAC / 60 Hz
Temp. Range: 57-97°F (15-35°C)
Coverage: Up to 1,500 sq. ft. (140 m2)
Dimensions:
• Height 22 5/16'' (56.7 cm)
• Width 8 5/8'' (21.9 cm)
• Depth 6 1/2'' (16.5 cm)
• Weight 7 lb (3.175 kg)
Oscillation: 50° radius

1-Year Warranty",300.00,110.00,product,Beyond by Aerus,675,Aerus,0,1,1
